This product includes software developed by recipient-screening contributors.

recipient-screening is a deterministic sanctions and on-chain risk
screening engine for external multisig signing requests, implementing
the screening mandate of the External Multisig Signing Request
Checklist v1, item 9 (OFAC SDN, UN, EU, UK + on-chain risk indicators).

Sanctions list data is fetched at runtime from the official publishers
(US Treasury OFAC, UN Security Council, EU FSD, UK OFSI) and remains
subject to each publisher's terms. Consolidated screening data queried
via the OpenSanctions API is subject to OpenSanctions' terms
(https://www.opensanctions.org/licensing/).

For more information, visit: https://github.com/svetlink90/recipient-screening
